{"updated":"2026-11-23T03:14:21.438Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"Df_3KM2E6kw","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df_3KM2E6kw","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"最近使用了Gemini新出的模型\nGemini Neon真的很不錯\n可愛龍不是可愛龍了\nGemini黑色星期五有半價優惠喔\n有興趣的可以訂閱起來到11/26","timestamp":"2026-11-21T09:02:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df_3KIBE4FA","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df_3KIBE4FA","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"x.com/vikas…\none.google.com/intl…","timestamp":"2026-11-21T09:02:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df_EzLljgnW","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df_EzLljgnW","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Three.js 做遊戲，場景一定要靠程式碼一個物件一個物件擺嗎？\n\nThree Studio 把這段做成了桌面編輯器：拖模型進場景、擺燈光和碰撞區，掛上 TypeScript 互動，按 Play 就能在同一個視窗測。做完還能匯出靜態網頁，讓別人用瀏覽器玩。\n\n如果你想做「走到門前，按一下就開門」的小關卡，這個 repo 值得拆：場景負責擺門，碰撞區決定何時能互動，程式負責門怎麼動。不用把三件事都寫死在同一個檔案裡。\n\nMIT 開源，目前是概念驗證，安裝檔未簽署。我會先拿來做原型，不急著把整款遊戲搬過去。\n\nGitHub：github.com/three…","timestamp":"2026-11-21T01:42:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df9ZOI1ipF7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df9ZOI1ipF7","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"AI 回了合法的 JSON，客服工單還是可能分錯。\n\n今晚花 5 分鐘，不用裝工具。假設工單是「所有使用者都無法登入」，優先級只接受 high 或 normal，這題應該是 high。\n\n試著判這四個輸出：\n① {\"priority\":\"high\"}\n② 結果如下：{\"priority\":\"high\"}\n③ {\"priority\":\"urgent\"}\n④ {\"priority\":\"normal\"}\n\n依序查：整段能解析嗎？值在允許範圍嗎？分級合理嗎？②、③、④ 各錯在不同關。\n\nPromptfoo 官方指南有自動化測法：\npromptfoo.dev/docs…","timestamp":"2026-11-20T10:02:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df9U4dpk5Ta","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df9U4dpk5Ta","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"考過AI應用規劃師了！\n幾乎沒怎麼準備（算是低分飛過\n這次根本是考國文程度\n題目都超級長\n本來以為不會過了\n居然過了\n證照+1\n#IPAS #AI","timestamp":"2026-11-20T09:24:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DgC-Jt3jAJe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgC-Jt3jAJe","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"『被很好的gay朋友告白該怎麼辦』\n\n我是鋼鐵直男，有一個gay朋友\n我們是很好很好的大學同學\n有次系上一群人一起出去玩\n他問我\n他：能不能跟你擠一張床睡覺？\n我當下並沒有甚麼感覺\n也同意了他的請求\n那天半夜他躺在我的旁邊問我\n他：你有沒有可能會喜歡男生？\n我：絕對不可能，就像你不會喜歡女生一樣\n他：其實我是故意想跟你獨處的，你不要生氣\n我：不會啊，你想說什麼嗎？\n他：其實我一直都很喜歡你。\n當下整個世界安靜了好久\n氣氛有些尷尬\n當下我不知道該怎麼反應\n完全沒想到他會跟我告白\n但是我還是決定堅定地告訴他我的想法\n我：你是我最好的兄弟，但是我對你絕對不是你想的那種感覺。\n他：對不起。\n我：我是有嚇到，但告白又不會怎樣，不要道歉啊你！\n他：以後我會保持好距離，不會讓你覺得尷尬或是不舒服。\n他：我們還是朋友吧？\n我：那當然，最好的朋友。","timestamp":"2026-11-22T14:00:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":693,"replies":50,"reposts":6,"shares":295},"score":811,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T05:03:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgC-K1BjHLb","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgC-K1BjHLb","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"隔天之後\n他再也不會主動來找我\n我像平常一樣約打球約吃飯約圖書館\n他能避開就避開\n在學校碰到甚至不會直視我的眼睛\n突然變得好像陌生人一樣\n不到交惡\n但是他很明顯刻意地躲著我\n\n真的很不喜歡有人會說\n：是有多缺朋友？\n我們一起經歷了太多艱難的時刻\n在我不被家人理解被趕出家門的時候\n在他的親人生病過世的時候\n我們剛好都互相陪伴在彼此身邊\n說真的我很難過\n我很珍惜這份情誼\n很想嘗試修復這段友情\n但是同時也不希望他因為我而越陷越深\n\n不知道有沒有人曾經有過\n被最好的朋友或兄弟告白的經驗？","timestamp":"2026-11-22T14:01:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":139,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":7},"score":145,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T05:03:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgC-L-3DN2R","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgC-L-3DN2R","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家如果遇到這種事會如何處理呢⁉️\n留言妳的想法吧\n\n原文來自✨被很好的gay朋友告白該怎麼辦✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多相關討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-22T14:01:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":11,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T05:03:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgC3SE5j2IJ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgC3SE5j2IJ","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"卡友覺得\n『比起反駁型人格 他更討厭討拍型人格』\n以下主張：\n\n先說我對反駁型人格的看法吧！\n現在人說真的也是很多奇怪\n陳述事實、提出意見、撥亂反正\n都會被貼上反駁型人格的標籤\n\n反駁型人格單純就是像刺蝟跟河豚\n講白一點就是比較白目\n反駁的內容不一定都是錯的\n\n其次那是他的看法，他不會想在乎別人怎麼想\n所以對付這種人的方法就是不用跟這種人吵\n如果真的要懟這種人就跟他說\n你講了這麼多，你先做到不要唬爛\n再反駁就拿證據給他看\n再不行就照正規流程處理（報警阿第三方公正之類的）","timestamp":"2026-11-22T13:00:51.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":17,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T05:03:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgC3Titj7CW","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgC3Titj7CW","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"反倒討拍型人格才真的才討厭\n\n最常見就自己有問題\n結果一直希望別人要要給他們情緒價值\n\n或是故意營造自己很自卑\n就像明明自己都拿全班最高分\n然後故意問別人說說我是不是很爛\n然後就是希望大家想稱讚他\n\n現在因為一句不合就會到處被人公審\n如果是陳述事實完整表述就算了\n偏偏討拍型人格最喜歡斷章取義\n只要內容呈現對自己有利的🙄🙄\n「我很善良被欺負」「我很可憐」\n搏取大眾同情得到同情分\n讓大家完全不分是非瘋狂出征\n\n討拍型人格難處理\n是因為這種人就是喜歡求關注\n你不喜歡，他就用更強烈的手段博取同情\n最後是搞得與事實脫離讓當事者要花更大的精神去澄清","timestamp":"2026-11-22T13:01:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T05:03:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgC3U9Oj5zY","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgC3U9Oj5zY","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B1：沒有喔，反駁型人格比較討厭","timestamp":"2026-11-22T13:01:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T05:03:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgC3WFoj3D5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgC3WFoj3D5","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B5：你就是反駁型人格才覺得反駁型人格不討厭","timestamp":"2026-11-22T13:01:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T05:03:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCwWBUDXUU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCwWBUDXUU","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"我想知道\n到底有多少人會瞞著家人偷偷出國？\n\n說真的 如果是背包客\n現在到日本的時間和金錢成本\n其實跟去南部差不多了\n但每次跟家人說要出國 家人就一直唸\n說我今年去了兩次日本了\n錢花太兇 怎麼都不跟他去之類的\n有嘗試溝通過但還是沒用\n導致我有想自己偷偷出去的念頭\n跟家人說我去南部玩\n(以前就常跟朋友去南部玩 所以可以很自然)\n實際上跑到日本\n因為有些行程我不希望家人介入\n只想要自己走\n\n大家覺得這要如何解決呢⁉️","timestamp":"2026-11-22T12:00:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCwXjRjTVe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCwXjRjTVe","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B3：我不住家裡\n平常家人不會聯絡\n根本不知道我去哪","timestamp":"2026-11-22T12:00:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCwYjEjTDm","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCwYjEjTDm","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B9：下個月要偷偷去紐約\n還在擔心時差會不會被發現🫠","timestamp":"2026-11-22T12:00:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCwZeljTvO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCwZeljTvO","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨瞞著家人偷偷出國✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多出國的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-22T12:00:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCpiiAjvBI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCpiiAjvBI","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B9：如果是我，我不能接受\n你管他是不是真的屁話","timestamp":"2026-11-22T11:00:46.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgCphk-DoTf","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCphk-DoTf","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B23：光是載女生不報備就知道他的心思了","timestamp":"2026-11-22T11:00:38.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgCpggLDlA_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCpggLDlA_","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B8：負責任的告訴你 不是玩笑話","timestamp":"2026-11-22T11:00:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgCpfQSDuMI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCpfQSDuMI","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"這題怎解⁉️在線急‼️\n\n前陣子男友生日與他的朋友一起去夜唱\n我身體不適 在家沒一起去\n\n今天在使用男友手機時\n剛好跳出男友好友的訊息\n因好奇心驅使，於是我點進去看後發現\n那天夜唱完男友載一個女生回家沒告訴我\n並且男友與男友好友的對話如下\n🤥男友 🫥男友好友\n🤥：剛剛差點把持不住\n🫥：你直接載她回家 沒去別的地方喔\n🤥：我下次就跟她一起回去 以前沒發現她是潛力股 越看越不錯\n🫥：你一起去的話 她也不會說什麼\n\n後來當然是與男友大吵一架\n他說是男生之間的屁話\n雖然男友確實沒做出對不起我的事且道歉認錯\n但我還是想問問，男生之間的屁話真的會拿女生朋友來講嗎？","timestamp":"2026-11-22T11:00:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":7,"reposts":0,"shares":6},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgCirKGCdAb","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCirKGCdAb","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"被厚比哥肘擊 超級驚嚇","timestamp":"2026-11-22T10:00:47.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgCip1QCf0Z","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCip1QCf0Z","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"好喝也嚇到ㅋㅋㅋㅋ","timestamp":"2026-11-22T10:00:36.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgCioKzCcwK","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCioKzCcwK","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨防彈V被嚇到的時候 ㅋㅋㅋ [pann]✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多V的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-22T10:00:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgCim2TiZ-3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCim2TiZ-3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"防彈V被嚇到的時候⋯⋯\n\n大眼睛會變得更大\n嘴巴也會\"嗚哇\"\n像漫畫人物一樣ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ\n超級可愛ㅋㅋㅋㅋ\n\n（按讚有驚喜嘻嘻嘻嘻）","timestamp":"2026-11-22T10:00:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":30,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":40,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"DgESM3Ck8IM","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgESM3Ck8IM","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"家裡換路由器，Wi-Fi 6、6E 和 7 怎麼選？6E 多了 6 GHz 頻段，Wi-Fi 7 還支援多重連線。買之前先盤點手機和電腦支援的規格、家裡的寬頻速度，再看看有沒有隔間多、訊號進不去的房間。三代的差異與選購取捨一次整理。\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-23T02:15:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T11:15:11+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgC0BaalKEj","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgC0BaalKEj","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"在簡報裡只想改圖的背景，卻怕人物跟著變？Google Pics 換上 Nano Banana 2.1，Google 表示新版更能保留未指定修改的區域，也改善圖中文字的呈現。更新涵蓋 Docs 和 Slides 裡的 Pics 工具，適用方案整理在文內。\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-22T12:32:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgC0B5jlIcb","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgC0B5jlIcb","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-22T12:32:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCst5_FLKh","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgCst5_FLKh","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"店名：呷便飯\n地址：台南市中西區民族路三段171號\n營業時間：下午四點半到早上六點","timestamp":"2026-11-22T11:28:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCfxxnlGaa","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgCfxxnlGaa","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"想在本機跑 AI 模型，主機得佔多大空間？微星新推出的 EdgeMesa N AI+ 採用 NVIDIA RTX Spark N1X，CPU 和 GPU 共用最高 128 GB 記憶體，搭載 Windows 11。文章整理了兩種出廠配置，以及桌面連接埠和散熱設計。\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-22T09:35:28.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCfyQylEyj","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgCfyQylEyj","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-22T09:35:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCZSPACp3F","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgCZSPACp3F","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"特斯拉 FSD v15 來了！畫面像 GTA，新功能一次看\n\n特斯拉 FSD v15 開始推送！中控螢幕上整條街被 AI 即時畫出來，馬斯克說像在玩 GTA。實境視圖、測速照相減速、自行車架模式、新視覺編碼器…新功能 2 分 49 秒一次看。官方說危險狀況處理好 25 倍，但只給倍數；台灣仍在審查中。你最想試哪一個？","timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:39:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":12,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":10},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"Df_wzTJo1A6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/Df_wzTJo1A6","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"透過AI經營自媒體，一個月漲粉將近五萬，把Skills開放不就代表會快速多很多競爭帳號？！\n\n這是我收到最多的問題！\n\n很多人很意外我會把AI懶人報完整的Skills都公開在課程包，但我並不擔心，因為我覺得這並不是懶人報最有價值的部分，真的要打造一個AI Agent系統，最有用的反而是讓大家知道我踩過的坑，我如何使用這些大家都能拿到的工具，做出大家想看高價值的內容，如何透過試錯調整優化pipeline的底層邏輯，如何打造人和Agent協作的系統，我都做成了一個小時的內容幫大家好好拆解了！\n\n這些Skills跟風格，我任何都可以非常快速的迭代變化，唯一不變讓你更有競爭力的是Mindset跟品味，也是為什麼我認為這堂課最有料的部分，目前早鳥價65折，有夠超值🔥💪","timestamp":"2026-11-21T08:06:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":21,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":25,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df_wzO1Ixf9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/Df_wzO1Ixf9","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"portaly.cc/ailrb…","timestamp":"2026-11-21T08:06:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df9MkcGI7HR","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/Df9MkcGI7HR","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"昨天課程上線一天已經超過12個人購買，進帳超過五萬台幣，真的非常謝謝大家的支持！小的我受寵若驚🥹😭\n\n不出意料的，很多人對賣課程很反感，覺得賣課程就是割韭菜，但我在市場上還沒看到有人會公開自己完整的自媒體工作流程，同時直接附上自己每天在使用的skills，概念大家都知道，不就是叫AI做事，去跟他們協作，叫Claude剪片，然後自動發布？\n\n用說的很簡單，全世界都在教你用Claude剪片，但要把它真的實作成一套穩定長期運作的系統，有做過的人才會知道有多困難，該使用什麼工具，該怎麼跟AI溝通，如何將AI的槓桿盡可能開到最大，降低人的介入，但還是可以保持產出的品質，不產出AI Slop，是大部分人沒有經驗的。\n\n我提供的價值，就是把我的Skills公開，讓大家可以參考更快的客製化成自己可以用的，把過去一年的經驗整理成60分鐘的影片，包括在過程中的學習，踩過的坑，各種細節的決策判斷等等。\n\n更甭說，我一個月Claude訂閱USD $200，Elevenlabs $100，爬蟲$30，不找點辦法回本，是要怎麼繼續產出更優質內容😂\n\n總之，這堂課我是真心覺得太划算了，推推！🎁","timestamp":"2026-11-20T08:11:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":182,"replies":19,"reposts":11,"shares":53},"score":253,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df9MkXJI6id","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/Df9MkXJI6id","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"portaly.cc/ailrb…","timestamp":"2026-11-20T08:11:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":10},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DgC9dlej6WT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgC9dlej6WT","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"AI 自動化剪片又突破到下一個層級了！\n\n如果你也是無法放心整支影片都給 AI 剪\n現在又多了一個強大的工具可以用\n而且完全免費\n\nMeta Edit 有 MacOS 版本，而且內建 MCP 讓 AI 操作\n所以影片上的動作全部是 Claude 自己做的\n1. 匯入素材\n2. 挑選背景音樂\n3. 逐段加上音效\n4. 還能幫忙設定轉場\n（影片沒有做任何加速）\n\n也就是說 AI 可以照著你想要的方式快速完成初剪\n你再回來做最後的精修跟調整就好","timestamp":"2026-11-22T13:59:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":34,"replies":1,"reposts":5,"shares":22},"score":51,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T05:03:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgAdD3wzeaT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgAdD3wzeaT","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"居然可以用 AI 來操作 Meta Developer 後台\n\nMeta 最近推出\nMeta Social Technologies MCP\n串到 AI 後，就能請 AI 幫你建立一個 Developer App\n然後... 就只能這樣了 🫠\n頂多再幫忙開好 使用者場景\n\n什麼時候會用到 Meta 開發者後台？\n當你需要用自動化串接 Threads, IG, FB 粉專\n例如讓 AI 幫你發文，或是取得裡面的分析數據\n\n目前這工具偏向工程師\n一般使用者需要的 Token 無法直接建立\n相信是安全考量，這部分很難自動化\n但管理 App 上面的設定或是取得使用量等等還是蠻方便","timestamp":"2026-11-21T14:33:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":26,"replies":5,"reposts":1,"shares":26},"score":39,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgAgvdIH--j","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgAgvdIH--j","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"developers.facebook.com/docum…","timestamp":"2026-11-21T15:05:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df_Wbc1EYnV","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df_Wbc1EYnV","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Google AI 方案居然有黑五\nPlus 和 Pro 的年繳可以 5 折！\n\n但現在的會員早鳥期間\n能不能看到特價是個謎\n蠻多人在社群上都反應看不到的\n\nPro 算下來一年 100 美金左右而已\n光有 Google Drive 2tb 都賺\n\nGoogle 的 AI 模型最近也是脫胎換骨一輪\nGemini 4 改用化學老師後跑分表現都還不錯\n或許是個訂閱的好時機\n\n⚠️ 是年訂閱方案，如果覺得自己會後悔那就得等一年後才能取消","timestamp":"2026-11-21T04:16:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":105,"replies":42,"reposts":2,"shares":135},"score":195,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df_ZvbnEWr3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df_ZvbnEWr3","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"連結：one.google.com/ai…\n\n勘誤：Drive 是5tb","timestamp":"2026-11-21T04:45:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":6},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df9Y45Oj9-T","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df9Y45Oj9-T","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"我是不是也在產 AI Slop？\n\n這幾天看到不少關於 AI Slop 的討論\n目前我自己的標準很簡單粗暴：\n1. 對我有沒有幫助\n2. 我自己看不看得下去\n\n會自我懷疑主要是因為近期的圖文跟動畫影片\n也開始大量仰賴 AI\n然後搭配自己的系統自動發布到多個平台\n\n只是通常讓 AI 產圖文或影片這部分\n往往會卡在我身上很久\n\n例如這只是輪播的其中一頁\n我卻在那邊刁 AI \n直到有一版是符合我理想的樣子為止","timestamp":"2026-11-20T10:10:06.000Z","stats":{"likes":28,"replies":14,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":56,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df9aKcDn-CN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df9aKcDn-CN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"從最近的 IG 版面來看\n其實每篇貼文也都還在尋找適合的風格跟版型\n\n體感上來說 AI 會越做越順手\n至於為什麼花了不少心力在訓練 AI 做圖文跟影片\n\n因為我喜歡在解釋或是說明的時候\n是帶有畫面來視覺化的\n這也是對我自己來說最好吸收的格式\n\n最近全自動化剪片很熱門\n如果是追求流量來做，那成功機率真的不高\n畢竟你自己都很難看出這支影片吸引不吸引人\n\n但可能這件事只要能幫我解決我懶得剪的部分\n那對我來說就很有價值\n自動化就是幫自己偷懶，幫自己省下不想花時間的地方啦","timestamp":"2026-11-20T10:10:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df7Me8an1i6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df7Me8an1i6","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"廠商們，AI 都幫你們設計好了\n\n這鍵帽如果聯名成功應該很讚\n\n如果到時候用電腦玩，星星數可以直接顯示在鍵盤上...","timestamp":"2026-11-19T13:32:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":10,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[{"id":"Df_zxWBCfMC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@c.yu.an_/post/Df_zxWBCfMC","username":"c.yu.an_","displayName":"c.yu.an_","content":"搞新創會開始染上出國才會解壓的習慣（？","timestamp":"2026-11-21T08:32:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":19,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}